  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a bowl, mix together tahini, olive oil, garlic, paprika, salt free seasoning, and black pepper",
    "Add the beef strips to the bowl and toss to coat with the tahini mixture",
    "Thread the beef strips onto skewers",
    "Grill the skewers for 10 minutes per side",
    "Brush the skewers with lemon juice during the last 2 minutes of grilling",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving",
    "Serve the skewers hot and enjoy"
  ],
